 **Anti-Patterns (Do Not Do)**:
+
 - Using npm/yarn instead of bun
 - Using `@types/node` instead of `bun-types`
 - Suppressing TypeScript errors with `as any`, `@ts-ignore`, `@ts-expect-error`
